{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>原定周五掛牌的瘦西湖文旅，延遲上市計劃。</p><p></p><p>水上遊覽服務提供商瘦西湖文旅宣布，經考慮多項因素，包括現行市況等，決定延遲首次公開發售計劃，認購款項將於本周五安排退還。</p><p></p><p>每股招股價最高5.07元，發售4,476萬股H股，當中一成本港發售，餘額國際發售，集資最多逾2.26億元。本周二截止認購。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T23:20:18.901727+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:41.107472+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:18:09.760898+00:00","content_hash":"7486e1293cf7304ee270674200ef3990777e67d75a2e43689166e6ec6ee95fb0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}